      "dcterms:title": "A SURVEY OF TWISTED ALEXANDER POLYNOMIALS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "FRIEDL, STEFAN",
        "VIDUSSI, STEFANO"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20100208",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/0905.0591",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We give a short introduction to the theory of twisted Alexander polynomials of a 3–manifold associated to a representation of its fundamental group. We summarize their formal properties and we explain their relationship to twisted Reidemeister torsion. We then give a survey of the many applications of twisted invariants to the study of topological problems. We conclude with a short summary of the theory of higher order Alexander polynomials.",
